+# Activities
+
+Activities represent account timeline events across boards you have access to, such as card publications, assignments, triage moves, board changes, title changes, closures, and comments.
+
+## `GET /:account_slug/activities`
+
+Returns a paginated list of account activities you have access to, ordered newest first.
+
+__Query Parameters:__
+
+| Parameter | Description |
+|-----------|-------------|
+| `board_ids[]` | Filter by board ID(s) |
+| `creator_ids[]` | Filter by event creator user ID(s) |
+
+__Supported Actions:__
+
+`card_assigned`, `card_unassigned`, `card_published`, `card_closed`, `card_reopened`, `card_title_changed`, `card_board_changed`, `card_postponed`, `card_auto_postponed`, `card_triaged`, `card_sent_back_to_triage`, `comment_created`
+
+__Event Particulars:__
+
+| Action | `particulars` |
+|--------|---------------|
+| `card_assigned`, `card_unassigned` | `{ "assignee_ids": [...] }` |
+| `card_board_changed` | `{ "old_board": "...", "new_board": "..." }` |
+| `card_title_changed` | `{ "old_title": "...", "new_title": "..." }` |
+| `card_triaged` | `{ "column": "..." }` |
+| All other actions | `{}` |
+
+Missing board, title, or column values are returned as empty strings.
+
